# Template Name	KEY	TYPE	VISIBLE	DESC	BONUS
Minion Role	KEY:Adversary ~ Minion	TYPE:AdversaryRole	VISIBLE:YES	DESC:Defeated in a single hit. Excess damage spills over to adjacent minions in range.	BONUS:HP|CURRENTMAX|-100
Solo Role	KEY:Adversary ~ Solo	TYPE:AdversaryRole	VISIBLE:YES	DESC:Takes additional spotlight actions per round equal to the number of active PCs. Gains +2 Action Tokens.	BONUS:HP|CURRENTMAX|6
Horde Role	KEY:Adversary ~ Horde	TYPE:AdversaryRole	VISIBLE:YES	DESC:Acts as a collective unit. Deals damage scaling with current combined HP pools.
